(text "WIZ850io: two 1x6 sockets. Check the J1-J2 spacing against the WIZnet mechanical drawing before layout." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 499247eb-bcc8-4a39-9453-47c7268649f8))
(text "The W5500 is polled (no interrupt). JP3 routes INTn to expander 2 P06 if polling is not enough." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 824e87ed-f563-470d-bcb2-99c9bb42b7fe))
